{"id": "unknown-2026-08-29-003", "date": "2026-08-29", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 8, "week": 35, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["panel_price", "oled_penetration", "earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.25, "keywords": ["[否定]decline", "weak"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Visionox reported its financial results for the first half of 2026 with a slight decline in revenue", "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/visionox\">Visionox</a> reported its financial result for the first half of 2026. Visionox's revenues were 4 billion RMB ($595 million USD), down 2.85% from last year. The company said that this decline was due to a weak consumer smartphone market, declining panel prices and rising component prices.&nbsp;</p><div class=\"align-center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2024-08/Visionox-flexible-OLED-module-fab-Hefei.jpg\" target=\"_blan", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/visionox-reported-its-financial-results-first-half-2026-slight-decline-revenue", "type": "rss"}]}
